<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:20px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,avenir-lt-w05_35-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:20px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></span></span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--></div></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-m04ch9mw" class="comp-m04ch9mw" data-semantic-classname="button"><a data-testid="linkElement" href="https://www.inferlink.com/_files/ugd/1ebadf_afcf24fffc994fdb830c0a6e8c696560.pdf" target="_blank" class="StylableButton2545352419__root StylableButton2545352419__forcedColorsBackground style-m05h968e__root wixui-button StylableButton2545352419__link" aria-label="Read more details here..."><span class="StylableButton2545352419__container"><span class="StylableButton2545352419__label wixui-button__label" data-testid="stylablebutton-label">Read more details here...</span><span class="StylableButton2545352419__icon wixui-button__icon" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="stylablebutton-icon"><span><svg data-bbox="9 70.9 181 59" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 200 200">
    <g>
        <path d="M159 70.9l-2.2 2.4L183.6 99H9v3h174.6l-26.2 25.3 2.1 2.6 30.5-29.3-31-29.7z"></path>
    </g>
</svg>
</span></span></span></a></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--></div></section><!--/$--></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section id="comp-m048nulz" tabindex="-1" class="Le88gL comp-m048nulz wixui-section" data-block-level-container="ClassicSection"><div id="bgLayers_comp-m048nulz" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-m048nulz" class="QG9w8P"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LNYVZi ayCf9D"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-m048nulz" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-m048nulz" class="ROWgFb"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-m048nulzinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-m048nulzinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><section id="comp-m048numf1" class="comp-m048numf1 CeUMmm wixui-column-strip"><div id="bgLayers_comp-m048numf1" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-m048numf1" class="ktMZav"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="V9k0ll etGVsi"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-m048numf1" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-m048numf1" class="etSQ9j"></div></div><div data-testid="columns" class="Ak0vpt"><!--$--><div id="comp-m048numn" class="comp-m048numn FDI5TK wixui-column-strip__column"><div id="bgLayers_comp-m048numn" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-m048numn" class="QG9w8P"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LNYVZi ayCf9D"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-m048numn" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-m048numn" class="ROWgFb"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-m048numninlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-m048numninlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-m048nump2" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-m048nump2 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h4 class="font_4 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:38px;"><span style="font-size:38px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">points &nbsp;&middot; &nbsp;lines &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; polygons</span></h4></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-m0495dlq" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-m0495dlq wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#D99A50;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,avenir-lt-w05_35-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:400;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Extraction</span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;">Our artificial intelligence - based extraction system leverages map legends to automatically extract point, line and polygon features from rasterized images. Separate layers are created for each legend item containing vectorized information for each common objects.</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#D99A50;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,avenir-lt-w05_35-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:400;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Attributes</span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;">Attributes for each object are extracted along with the vectorized information and embedded in the attribute tables. Critical information such as dip direction, position etc are extracted</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#D99A50;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,avenir-lt-w05_35-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:400;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Georeferencing</span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;">Each map is analyzed for lat/long, metadata and other clues to help determine it&#39;s location on earth. Further image analysis is used to validate candidates and determine the most likely location.</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span>​</span>​</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#D99A50;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,avenir-lt-w05_35-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:400;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Search</span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;"><span style="letter-spacing:0em;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">All the information we extract is made searchable from object to attribute.&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#D99A50;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,avenir-lt-w05_35-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:400;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Workflow</span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;">Nobody&#39;s perfect...including computers. So we&#39;ve implemented a human-in-loop component of the workflow to help intuitively and efficiently correct last gap.</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></p></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-m048numw5" class="comp-m048numw5 FDI5TK wixui-column-strip__column"><div id="bgLayers_comp-m048numw5" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-m048numw5" class="QG9w8P"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LNYVZi ayCf9D"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-m048numw5" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-m048numw5" class="ROWgFb"><wow-image id="img_comp-m048numw5" class="Qh0lWW ayCf9D fO4mKs NgeJ4N bgImage" data-image-info="{&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-m048numw5&quot;,&quot;alignType&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;,&quot;targetWidth&quot;:491,&quot;targetHeight&quot;:1167,&quot;isLQIP&quot;:true,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;width&quot;:1256,&quot;height&quot;:1077,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;1ebadf_c95c7507e44e4ef9bc13480f6d6cedbc~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;}}" data-motion-part="BG_IMG comp-m048numw5" data-bg-effect-name="" data-has-ssr-src="true"><img src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/1ebadf_c95c7507e44e4ef9bc13480f6d6cedbc~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_123,h_105,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,blur_2,enc_avif,quality_auto/1ebadf_c95c7507e44e4ef9bc13480f6d6cedbc~mv2.jpg" alt="" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 50%" width="491" height="1167"/></wow-image></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-m048numw5inlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-m048numw5inlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-m05gnmx6" class="comp-m05gnmx6" data-semantic-classname="button"><a data-testid="linkElement" href="mailto:mapsense@inferlink.com?subject=mapsense%20pilot%20program" target="_self" class="StylableButton2545352419__root StylableButton2545352419__forcedColorsBackground style-m0